[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（約束の場所はこの辺りのはずだけど……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The meeting spot should be somewhere around here...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……銃声！？\u3000まさか、カロリン！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...A gunshot!? Don't tell me—Caroline!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "カロリン！\u3000加勢するよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline! I'm coming to help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディ！\u3000助かります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi! Thank goodness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おケガはありませんか、ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you all right? You're not hurt?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へへ、大丈夫。\nそっちこそ、派手にやるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh, I'm fine. Looks like you didn't hold back, though."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お恥ずかしい限りです。\nつい、身体が動いてしまいまして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How embarrassing. My body just... moved on its own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……こうして会うの、\n教会で一緒にシスターをやってた頃以来だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It's been a while since we've actually seen each other. Back to when we were both sisters at the church, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昔から腕っぷしは強かったけど、こんなだったっけ？\u3000\n会わない間に人って変わるもんだなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were always tough, but this? You've really changed since then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、これもすべて己の成長の証です。\nハイディも、随分頼もしくなられましたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It is simply a testament to my growth. Though I must say, you've become quite formidable yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうだ、これ。\nカロリンからの手紙、ちゃんと受け取ったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh, right. I got your letter."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここに書いてあったこと、本当なの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is everything in it true?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。嘘偽りなく、すべて事実です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Every word of it. I would not write to you with anything less than the full truth."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……父さんが、母さんに決闘を申し込んだって――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Our father challenged our mother to a duel?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]